MASTER STACK REGISTER
1.0–50.0 — ONEDRAFT CAD-AI / ARIA POWERED
The 50-stack architecture establishes the complete progression from foundational technical definition through executable software, computational modeling, regulatory analysis, documentation generation, runtime execution, security, operations, artificial intelligence, user interaction, commercialization, scalability and final end-to-end system integration.
The architecture therefore proceeds from specification → implementation → computation → orchestration → operation → integration, with each stack inheriting the contracts and system boundaries established by the preceding stacks.
